;    0: TWdLink(count=4358, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\夕焼け.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\新村本家洗面所.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>I was supposed to go to the kitchen and help get dinner ready.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But now I was standing face to face with the mirror in the washroom.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no particular reason for it, but whenever I face a mirror, I have a habit of letting out a big sigh.<PG>
But today, no sigh came out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The me in the mirror... what is she looking at?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I... what am I looking at, in the mirror?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Facing the reflection that looked exactly like me, I asked it in my heart.<PG>
That was when I noticed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The reflection in the mirror was shedding tears.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From one eye only, a drop slid smoothly down her <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="ほお">cheek</STYLE>, like water running down glass.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I put a hand to my own face and stroked it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A faint coolness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sure enough, I had been crying too.<PG>
The me in the mirror was my own self.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The moment I clearly realized that, the strength left me and I sank to my hands and knees on the floor.
{PLAYSND "SE\tumbling1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hung my head, and more tears spilled from my eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But no sound came out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The me in the mirror felt sad, and I was only empathizing with her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was that kind of strange sensation.<PG>
Why is the me in the mirror crying?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't know the reason.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... 
{PAUSE ""}
But the me in the mirror knows.<PG>
I've been holding it in all this time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Pushing myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since when have I been holding it in like this?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\体育館.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\部活.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
What I remember clearly is from middle school.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Back then, I wanted a starting spot in my club so badly that I practiced desperately every day.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> both supported me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Little by little, steadily, I got better―<PG>
In the spring of my third year of middle school, I won a starting spot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> were both happy for me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I told myself I'd work even harder, for the sake of the people who'd supported me this far.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even after I became a starter, I never slacked off, and I kept honing my skills.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But―<PG>
We lost the third-place match at the prefectural tournament in July, and we third-years retired.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was the first time I felt it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What had I been doing?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No matter that I'd become a starter, no matter how much better I'd gotten...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All the effort I'd piled up could be reduced to nothing, every bit of it, by a single moment.<PG>
I knew it was a selfish way to think.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could never say anything like that to <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When it was thanks to the two of them that I'd made it this far...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I kept it hidden, all this time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I lied to myself, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I just endured, and endured.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Today is the same.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The truth is, I wanted to run back home to Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My intuition told me Motoki-cho was going to disappear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But what if I think only about myself?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like back when <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> moved to Megasawa, all I'd have to do is move somewhere else too.<PG>
Because... because it's true, isn't it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Moving somewhere else, or going to Arata―which is safer?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Isn't the answer perfectly obvious...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why didn't I say back then that I wanted to run away?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> said it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I have the power of <STYLE ID="4">Necro</STYLE>, is there anywhere I could even run to?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So rather than going back to Motoki-cho, it's more constructive to face <STYLE ID="4">Necro</STYLE> here and find a way to solve this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know that much...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But is there any guarantee it'll work!? Any guarantee I'll get home safe!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no guarantee like that anywhere...!<PG>
All I can do is resent this power of mine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I didn't have this power, <STYLE ID="4">Necro</STYLE> wouldn't be <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="にら">glaring</STYLE> at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I could have just gone home to Motoki-cho, couldn't I?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Over and over in my heart, I repeat complaints it's far too late to do anything about.<PG>
In front of everyone, I make a point of acting strong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because I don't want to see everyone looking worried.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Rather than see that, I should just force a smile, even if it's a strain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I just have to say something that'll make people feel even a little more hopeful.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I just... 
{PAUSE ""}
push myself a little and hold it in, that's all.<PG>
I'm <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ひきょうもの">a coward</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I say things to look cool, while inside I let grudges like these pour out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The me in the mirror got tired of holding it in, and showed me what was in her heart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The me in the mirror is my own self―
{PAUSE ""}
and she's forced me to see the inside of me I don't want to see.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's why my tears won't stop.<PG>
I'm scared... I'm scared...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I want to run home right now...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whatever happens to the Arata settlement, it's got nothing to do with me...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They can't find <STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE>!? I've never even met her!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why do I have to be dragged into this...!<PG>
This is how I really feel.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is what's inside my <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ひきょう">cowardly</STYLE> heart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What do I do! What do I do to make it out of this...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The feeling of something <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="な">stroking</STYLE> my back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something gentle, warm and soothing was softly <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="な">stroking</STYLE> my back as I knelt with my head bowed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\新村本家洗面所.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It was <STYLE ID="10">Haruka's grandmother</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd heard about her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For 10 years <STYLE ID="10">she</STYLE> had been trying to prevent the curse-killings, and still she could see no lead toward solving them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE> stroked my back without saying a word.<PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"I'm sorry, I'm all right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I lifted my head, wiped my tears, and pulled my mouth into a <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="・">smile</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
See, I lied again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no way I was all right. All I wanted was to run away.<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">... I'm glad you came. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">That alone makes me happy enough."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was the first conversation I ever had with <STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet <STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE> seemed to understand everything inside me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The strength drained from my whole body once more, and the tears started welling up again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I could do was lean against <STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\エリカなつみ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE> stayed still, stroking my head, her hand on my back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> and the others went out a while ago, so it's just me in the house."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing that, I finally let go of my voice, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even at this point, had I still been holding back from crying out loud?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just how much of a <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ひきょうもの">coward</STYLE> am I, always trying to hide myself?<PG>
My body was seized by <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="おえつ">sobs</STYLE> so hard I couldn't control my breathing, and I shook all over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Crying wasn't going to solve anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But holding it in wasn't going to solve anything either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So right then, I gave myself over to what I wanted to do.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And that was <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="どうこく">wailing</STYLE>―crying out loud, unsightly as it was.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE> must be terribly afraid too, living in a place like this for 10 years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But whether it's because of her position as the Grand Witch, or because she loves this land―
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE> endures here in the Arata settlement, quietly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE> must want to run away too, if she could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE> must be far more afraid than I am.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know that.<PG>
But I clung to her selfishly, like a little child.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We both wanted to run away, and yet I cried selfishly, as if to say I was the one to be pitied.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And <STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE> quietly took it all in.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\新村本家洗面所.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Little by little, that turned into a feeling of shame.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wailing on the shoulder of someone I'd only just met.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Leaning on someone who'd been through more fear than me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Realizing this <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ひきょう">cowardly</STYLE> side of myself.<PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">... I'm sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The words slipped out without my meaning them to.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From a mouth that was about to say 'I want to run away,' words of apology came out on their own.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, there's no need to worry. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">I'll send you home safe and sound, I promise."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How to take those words is different for everyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Some would think it's a stock phrase to make a crying person stop crying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Others would think it is not something the head of a settlement where someone is killed every year should say.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I felt was neither of those.<PG>
What I felt was empathy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE> has a hometown besides this place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, there are circumstances that force her to stay here.<PG>
Those words: <STYLE ID="10">"I'll send you home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With those words, I thought: here is someone who understands how an outsider feels―something a person born and raised here could never know.<PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">... you're not from this settlement originally?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Hm? You think so?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　That's right. I moved here when I married in."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How much peace of mind there is in going home to a house that isn't here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt she understood that.<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"You see, when I married my husband, I made up my mind. Whatever happens, I'll protect this land to the end. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">And that goes for the people who live in this land, of course, and for any guests who come here, too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">It's 10 years now and I still haven't solved it, which is </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="ふがい">shameful</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">... but even so, my feelings haven't changed."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">, you're amazing... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">I'm just scared, that's all..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Of course you're scared. Without fear, you'll just do something reckless and fail. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">You'll</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> be all right, as long as you feel scared."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"But it's hard for me to tell everyone I'm scared... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">I can't tell them now that I forced myself and acted tough just to come here..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> must both know at least how </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> really feel. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">You're</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> always trying so hard not to make anyone worry, and they're bound to know it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I heard that, it hit me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At last I understood what I had been afraid of.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It went without saying that I felt my life was in danger in this frightening place.<PG>
But that wasn't all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I thought I'd have to keep holding it in, pushing myself, putting on a brave face from now on, forever, I felt like I might break.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How long would I have to keep hiding my <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ひきょう">cowardly</STYLE> feelings to go on living?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd started to grow tired of it.<PG>
I'm not... as strong a person as everyone thinks.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm a more <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ひきょう">cowardly</STYLE> person than anyone imagines.<PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">, I'm... I'm sure I'm a really weak person."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"I hear it from </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> all the time, that she has a precious friend she's had since the day she was born. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">But that girl pushes herself too hard sometimes, so she worries about her. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Be brave and tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> and the others just what you've been feeling. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Then not just </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> and the others will feel lighter too."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"Will it be okay...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"What if </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> were in the opposite position?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　If </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> opened up to you about what she'd been hiding in her heart all along, how would you feel?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"I don't really understand, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">I'd be happy, maybe... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Thinking she must have told me because she trusted me."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ指さしバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Then there's nothing left to worry about!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE> laid her hand on my shoulder with a pat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To <STYLE ID="17">someone I'd met for the first time today</STYLE>, I had <STYLE ID="18" RUBY="ざんげ">confessed</STYLE> what I'd never told anyone, and been given an answer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It didn't change the fact that I was still scared.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But at the same time, I felt reassured.<PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"Thank you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">. I'm really okay now!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="11"> and the others went off to investigate, so I'll help with dinner!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Heh heh, so </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> and the others were sneaking around looking into the curse-killings after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"Ah...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was supposed to be a secret, but I'd let it slip.<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Well, right now, even one more ally is a comfort. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> and the others will be back, so we'd better have a dinner ready that'll put some life back in them!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"Okay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Taking <STYLE ID="10">Obaasan's</STYLE> hand, I got briskly to my feet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was it because I'd cried so much, or because someone had listened to me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt wonderfully refreshed.<PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="11"> has such a wonderful </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">grandmother</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Heh heh, though </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> tells me, 'Act your age already, you cosplay hag!'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"Cosplay...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Well, I'll show you what that's about once dinner's done."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Deep in <STYLE ID="10">Obaasan's</STYLE> eyes, something seemed to glint with a mysterious light.
